mplement this knowledge into daily pract... View Details Bookmark Credential Specialist (2 positions) August 12, 2026 Staff Office of Academic Records The Credential Specialist provides high quality service as administrative support for the Office of Academic Records with an emphasis on credit evaluations of prospective and current students, development of course equivalency guide, and student record maintenance. This position also applies transfer credit updates for current students, processes course equivalencies, and supports other key uni... View Details Bookmark Lecturer in Religion August 12, 2026 Faculty Religion Department The Religion Department at Pacific Lutheran University invites applications for a part-time lecturer position to teach one section of Health and Healing in Christian History (RELI 229). This course will be taught online and asynchronously in January-term 2027, and open only to students enrolled in PLU’s Accelerated Bachelor of Science in Nursing (ABSN) program. The successful candidate will hav... View Details Bookmark BAS Maintenance Technician July 27, 2026 Staff Facilities Management The BAS Maintenance Technician serves as a critical “Hybrid Technician” bridging the gap between heavy mechanical infrastructure (HVAC, chillers, and boilers) and advanced digital controls systems (BAS/Low Voltage). Operating as the front line of campus infrastructure reliability, this position leverages building automation data, predictive diagnostics, and journey-level mechanical expertise to... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Student Financial Services July 23, 2026 Staff Student Financial Services The Assistant Director of Student Financial Services manages and oversees several critical financial aid programs while serving as a resource for students and families regarding financial aid and billing. This position reports to the Director of Financial Aid Operations. View Details Bookmark Nursing Faculty (Part-time) - Lynnwood April 29, 2026 Faculty Nursing, School of PLU maintains a part-time nursing faculty pool in all areas of nursing specialties (Geriatrics, Medical/Surgical, Maternity, Mental Health, Pediatrics, and Simulation) for available assignments during the academic year.The PLU School of Nursing is dedicated to fostering a diverse and inclusive academic environment. We actively encourage applications from individuals whose backgrounds or interes... View Details Bookmark Nursing Faculty (Part-time) - Tacoma April 29, 2026 Faculty Nursing, School of PLU maintains a part-time nursing faculty pool in all areas of nursing specialties (Geriatrics, Medical/Surgical, Maternity, Mental Health, Pediatrics, and Simulation) for available assignments during the academic year.The PLU School of Nursing is dedicated to fostering a diverse and inclusive academic environment. We actively encourage applications from individuals whose backgrounds or interes... View Details Bookmark Copyright © 2019 Pacific Lutheran University. All rights reserved. 12180 Park Ave. S Tacoma, WA 98447 (253) 535-7185 www.plu.edu To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
